    "4️⃣ O'ZINI TANISHTIRISH\n\n📌 My name is ... (Mening ismim ...):\n  My name is Bobur. (Mening ismim Bobur.)\n  My name is Dilfuza. (Mening ismim Dilfuza.)\n\n📌 I am from ... (Men ... danman):\n  I am from Tashkent. (Men Toshkentdanman.)\n  I am from Uzbekistan. (Men O'zbekistondanman.)\n\n📌 I am a ... (Men ... man):\n  I am a student. (Men talabaman.)\n  I am a teacher. (Men o'qituvchiman.)\n\n📌 Nice to meet you! (Tanishganimdan xursandman!)\n  A: Hello! Nice to meet you!\n  B: Nice to meet you too!",
    "5️⃣ XAYRLASHISH\n\n📌 RASMIY:\n  Goodbye! — Xayr! (eng rasmiy)\n  Good night! — Xayrli tun! (kechasi)\n  Have a nice day! — Kuningiz yaxshi o'tsin!\n\n📌 NORASMIY:\n  Bye! — Xayr!\n  See you later! — Keyinroq ko'rishguncha!\n  See you tomorrow! — Ertaga ko'rishguncha!\n  Take care! — O'zingizga qarab qoling!",
