    "1️⃣ ASOSIY RANGLAR (10 TA)\n\n📌 QIZIL OILASI:\n  • red — qizil\n  • orange — apelsinrang\n  • pink — pushti\n  • brown — jigarrang\n\n📌 KO'K OILASI:\n  • blue — ko'k\n  • green — yashil\n  • purple — binafsha\n  • gray — kulrang\n\n📌 ASOSIY:\n  • yellow — sariq\n  • black — qora\n  • white — oq",
    "2️⃣ 'WHAT COLOR IS IT?' QOIDASI\n\n📌 Savol:\n  What color is it? — U qanday rangda?\n  What color is your car? — Sizning mashinangiz qanday rangda?\n\n📌 Javob:\n  It is red. — U qizil.\n  My car is blue. — Mening mashinam ko'k.\n\n🔴 'a' artikl rang bilan ishlatilMAYdi:\n  ✅ It is red. ❌ It is a red.\n  ✅ The car is red. ❌ The car is a red.",
    "3️⃣ SHAKLLAR (SHAPES)\n\n📌 Asosiy shakllar:\n  • circle — doira\n  • square — kvadrat\n  • triangle — uchburchak\n  • rectangle — to'rtburchak\n  • star — yulduz\n  • heart — yurak\n  • oval — oval\n  • diamond — olmos\n\n📌 Shakl so'rash:\n  What shape is this? — Bu qanday shakl?\n  It is a circle. — Bu doira.\n\n🔴 Shakl oldidan 'a' artikl qo'yiladi (color emas):\n  ✅ It is a circle. ❌ It is circle.\n  ✅ What is this? A circle. ❌ What is this? Circle.",
    "4️⃣ SHAKLLAR HAQIDA GAPIRISH\n\n📌 Bu narsa qanday:\n  This is a red circle. (Bu qizil doira)\n  That is a blue square. (U ko'k kvadrat)\n\n📌 Ko'pligi:\n  I see two circles and three squares.\n  There are five stars in the sky.\n\n📌 'Siz' qo'shimchasi:\n  circle → circles\n  box → boxes (x bilan)\n  boy → boys",
    "5️⃣ 'THERE IS' / 'THERE ARE'\n\n📌 Bitta narsa:\n  There is a red car. (Qizil mashina bor)\n  There is a circle. (Doira bor)\n\n📌 Ko'p narsa:\n  There are three blue squares. (Uchta ko'k kvadrat bor)\n  There are many stars. (Ko'p yulduz bor)\n\n📌 So'rash:\n  How many circles are there? — Nechta doira bor?\n  There are five. — Besh.",
    "6️⃣ 'IT' VA 'THEY'\n\n📌 Bitta narsa haqida:\n  It is red. — U qizil.\n  It is a square. — U kvadrat.\n\n📌 Ko'p narsa haqida:\n  They are blue. — Ular ko'k.\n  They are circles. — Ular doiralar.\n\n🔴 Shakl → 'it is a [shape]'. Rang → 'it is [color]' (artiklsiz).",
